---
title: Overnight Apple Oats
servings: 1
course: Breakfast
locale: en
difficulty: Easy
---

> Alternative: Use 1 banana instead of apple and sultanas

In a bowl mix the @porridge oats{50%g} and @boiling water{85%ml} until it thickens.

Stir in the @low-fat plain or vanilla yoghurt{2%tbsp}, @apple{1}(grated, or 2 tbsp apple purée) and @sultanas{1%tbsp} (or banana), and @cinnamon{pinch}.

Pour into a jar or container, seal with a lid, and leave in the fridge overnight.

> Eat as-is, or sprinkle over some brown sugar, drizzle over some milk, and add some sliced apple (or banana).